#. macro: </ui-edge-color> — end of: text outline color from the UIColor sheet; </ui-edge-color> restores the previous color (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
#. macro: </ui-color> — end of: text color from the UIColor sheet; </ui-color> restores the previous color (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
msgctxt "Addon:10067:0:0"
msgid "Initiate a vote to abandon current duty.<br><ui-color 506><ui-edge-color 507>※Parties must wait 15 minutes from duty commencement<br>　before voting.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>"
msgstr "Начать голосование за отказ от задания.<br><ui-color 506><ui-edge-color 507>※ Голосовать можно не раньше чем через 15 минут после начала задания.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>"

