msgid "Accept Rematch"
msgstr "Принять реванш"

#. ja: 再戦確認中 <num $n1>/<num $n2>
#. de: Antworten: <num $n1>/<num $n2>
#. fr: Réponses<nbsp>: <num $n1>/<num $n2>
#. macro: <num $n1> — a number; value = number parameter 1 (game data: keep it; it may move or repeat)
